{"pages":[{"ocr":false,"w":612,"h":792,"segs":[["H OW TO L E A D A P R AY E R M E E T I N G 1",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,652.24549999999999,9,false],["HOW TO LEAD A",151.90000000000001,33.840599999999995,426.54000000000008,116.00059999999996,80,false],["PRAYER MEETING",151.90000000000001,93.840599999999995,464.46000000000004,176.00059999999996,80,false],["Group prayer needs to be the staple of our fellowship",146.40000000000001,225.43489999999986,345.86700000000002,237.8368999999999,9,false],["just as it was for the very first believers.",146.40000000000001,238.43089999999984,296.48400000000004,250.83289999999988,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,253.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,265.8368999999999,9,false],["Acts 12:12 - Peter went to the house of Mary",164.40000000000001,252.43489999999986,330.16200000000003,264.8368999999999,9,false],["where others gathered for prayer.",164.40000000000001,264.43189999999981,290.40000000000003,276.83389999999986,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,277.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,289.83689999999996,9,false],["Acts 1:13-14 - scripture records that all with one",164.40000000000001,277.43489999999997,345.69600000000008,289.83689999999996,9,false],["mind were continually devoting themselves to",164.40000000000001,289.43189999999998,339.28800000000001,301.83389999999997,9,false],["prayer, along with the women.",164.40000000000001,302.42789999999997,278.21400000000006,314.82989999999995,9,false],["Introduce a prayer topic or request, one at a time then",370.20000000000005,225.43489999999986,573.31200000000013,237.8368999999999,9,false],["allow the group a few minutes to pray for the that.",370.20000000000005,238.43089999999984,557.58000000000015,250.83289999999988,9,false],["When finished, the leader introduces another topic or",370.20000000000005,251.42689999999982,573.16800000000023,263.82889999999986,9,false],["request. Designate a specific person to close at the",370.20000000000005,264.4228999999998,559.35300000000007,276.82489999999984,9,false],["end of each time. This helps insure that the prayer",370.20000000000005,277.41889999999989,559.65900000000022,289.82089999999988,9,false],["time will not bog down when everyone has had the",370.20000000000005,290.41489999999988,560.40600000000018,302.81689999999986,9,false],["opportunity to pray if they so desire. Below are some",370.20000000000005,303.41089999999986,568.173,315.81289999999984,9,false],["examples of topics that can be used:",370.20000000000005,316.40689999999984,505.11000000000007,328.80889999999982,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,342.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,354.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,368.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,380.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,394.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,406.83689999999996,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,420.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,432.83689999999996,9,false],["Thank God for His love, forgiveness, the beautiful",388.20000000000005,342.43489999999997,575.63400000000001,354.83689999999996,9,false],["day, the ways He is working in peoples lives, etc.",388.20000000000005,355.43089999999995,568.90200000000004,367.83289999999994,9,false],["Thank God for something that has happened in",388.20000000000005,368.43489999999997,566.36400000000015,380.83689999999996,9,false],["your life in the past 24 hours.",388.20000000000005,381.43089999999995,498.00000000000011,393.83289999999994,9,false],["Please help _______________ (you or someone",388.20000000000005,394.43489999999997,557.11200000000008,406.83689999999996,9,false],["else).",388.20000000000005,407.43089999999995,408.36900000000003,419.83289999999994,9,false],["Thank God for how He will answer your requests.",388.20000000000005,420.43489999999997,575.31000000000017,432.83689999999996,9,false],["CONVERSATIONAL PRAYER",146.40000000000001,439.81989999999996,264.25999999999999,460.35989999999998,20,false],["During conversational prayer group members should",146.40000000000001,459.43489999999997,346.90200000000004,471.83689999999996,9,false],["talk to God as they would talk to a friend. Encourage",146.40000000000001,472.43089999999995,342.87900000000013,484.83289999999994,9,false],["the group (especially a group unfamiliar with group",146.40000000000001,485.42689999999993,340.90800000000013,497.82889999999992,9,false],["prayer) to feel free to pray sentence prayers. Everyone",146.40000000000001,498.42289999999991,350.34900000000005,510.8248999999999,9,false],["is free to pray, or not to pray, as the Spirit directs.",146.40000000000001,511.41889999999989,330.54000000000008,523.82089999999994,9,false],["Don’t worry about silence. Allow God to speak to",146.40000000000001,524.41489999999988,329.88300000000015,536.81689999999981,9,false],["everyone in the group during times of silence.",146.40000000000001,537.41089999999986,318.59700000000009,549.8128999999999,9,false],["LET THE GROUP MEMBERS SHARE PRAYER REQUESTS",370.20000000000005,456.91489999999999,547.81500000000005,472.31989999999996,15,false],["Go around the group allowing each member to share",370.20000000000005,472.43489999999997,567.63300000000027,484.83689999999996,9,false],["their own personal prayer requests.",370.20000000000005,485.43089999999995,504.44400000000007,497.83289999999994,9,false],["PRAY USING SCRIPTURE",370.20000000000005,521.91489999999999,450.42000000000007,537.31989999999996,15,false],["Have the group use one or more passages of Scripture",370.20000000000005,537.43489999999997,572.27700000000027,549.83690000000001,9,false],["as their guide for praying. Choose any passage you feel",370.20000000000005,550.43090000000007,574.78800000000012,562.8329,9,false],["is appropriate. Here’s an example:",370.20000000000005,563.42689999999993,498.3780000000001,575.82889999999998,9,false],["ELEMENTS OF A GROUP PRAYER MEETING",146.40000000000001,569.81989999999996,330.24000000000001,590.35989999999993,20,false],["A Choose one or more of following elements for",146.40000000000001,589.43489999999997,325.87800000000016,601.83690000000001,9,false],["your prayer meeting. Be Creative!You can switch",146.40000000000001,602.43090000000007,330.80100000000016,614.8329,9,false],["the elements around, eliminate some of them or do",146.40000000000001,615.42689999999993,338.29800000000012,627.82889999999998,9,false],["something completely different. Don’t make prayer",146.40000000000001,628.42290000000003,339.4860000000001,640.82490000000007,9,false],["boring or monotonous. It’s an inspirational and",146.40000000000001,641.41890000000001,324.58200000000011,653.82090000000005,9,false],["enjoyable time where students leave feeling refreshed",146.40000000000001,654.41489999999999,350.11500000000001,666.81690000000003,9,false],["and renewed.",146.40000000000001,667.41089999999997,197.19600000000003,679.81290000000001,9,false],["Read a Psalm of praise (e.g. Psalm 103; Psalm 145; 150)",370.20000000000005,589.42790000000002,575.6160000000001,601.82989999999995,9,false],["or teach the group to pray using the following:",370.20000000000005,602.4239,543.01800000000014,614.82590000000005,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,628.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,640.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,667.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,679.83690000000001,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,705.83690000000001,9,false],["INTRODUCE A PRAYER TOPIC OR REQUEST",146.40000000000001,703.91489999999999,285.01499999999999,719.31989999999996,15,false],["The first person reads a phrase or verse aloud",388.20000000000005,628.43489999999997,559.452,640.83690000000001,9,false],["then prays a simple prayer relating to the phrase",388.20000000000005,641.43090000000007,570.54000000000019,653.8329,9,false],["or scripture verse.",388.20000000000005,654.42689999999993,457.23900000000003,666.82889999999998,9,false],["Other members of the group join in audibly or",388.20000000000005,667.43489999999997,561.14400000000012,679.83690000000001,9,false],["silently agree.",388.20000000000005,680.43089999999995,441.05700000000007,692.8329,9,false],["The next person reads a different verse then",388.20000000000005,693.43489999999997,554.43000000000006,705.83690000000001,9,false],["pauses to pray aloud.",388.20000000000005,706.43089999999995,467.202,718.8329,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]]},{"ocr":false,"w":612,"segs":[["H OW TO L E A D A P R AY E R M E E T I N G 2",43.841199999999994,509.49990000000003,57.071200000000005,653.03739999999993,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,45.836899999999901,9,false],["Others follow with their prayers.",164.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,288.00600000000009,45.836899999999901,9,false],["USE THE ‘ACTS’ ACROSTIC",146.40000000000001,69.914899999999989,231.61500000000001,85.319899999999961,15,false],["Prayer using the ACTS acrostic would look like this:",146.40000000000001,85.434899999999857,342.81600000000003,97.836899999999901,9,false],["Adoration: Worshipping and praising God with your",146.40000000000001,111.34589999999992,344.48100000000011,124.05389999999989,9,false],["heart, mind and voice.",146.40000000000001,124.43189999999981,230.19,136.83389999999986,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,162.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,214.8368999999999,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,228.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,240.8368999999999,9,false],["Praise and pray through a Psalm, sing, adore God,",164.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,350.31300000000005,162.8368999999999,9,false],["praising Him for His attributes such as: loving",164.40000000000001,163.43089999999984,338.649,175.83289999999988,9,false],["kindness, holiness, compassion, majesty, etc.",164.40000000000001,176.42689999999982,333.72600000000011,188.82889999999986,9,false],["Praise Him for who He is.",164.40000000000001,189.4228999999998,260.99700000000007,201.82489999999984,9,false],["Sing a hymn and use the words of the hymn to",164.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,337.0920000000001,214.8368999999999,9,false],["guide the your time for prayer.",164.40000000000001,215.43089999999984,278.60100000000006,227.83289999999988,9,false],["Select a few of God’s attributes and spend",164.40000000000001,228.43489999999986,321.53100000000006,240.8368999999999,9,false],["the time meditating and praising Him for His",164.40000000000001,241.43089999999984,335.31000000000006,253.83289999999988,9,false],["character. Share answers to prayer and notice",164.40000000000001,254.42689999999982,337.32600000000014,266.82889999999986,9,false],["how these answers reflect different aspects of",164.40000000000001,267.4228999999998,337.05600000000004,279.82489999999984,9,false],["His character. Spend time thanking God for the",164.40000000000001,280.41889999999989,343.0680000000001,292.82089999999988,9,false],["answers and His faithfulness.",164.40000000000001,293.41489999999988,276.37800000000004,305.81689999999986,9,false],["Confession: Agreeing with God concerning any sins",146.40000000000001,319.08289999999988,341.69100000000003,332.46589999999986,9,false],["He brings to your mind.",146.40000000000001,332.41189999999983,235.67099999999999,344.81389999999982,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,370.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,383.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,396.83689999999996,9,false],["Review I John 1:5-9",164.40000000000001,358.43489999999997,239.27100000000002,370.83689999999996,9,false],["God will bring to mind what you need to confess.",164.40000000000001,371.43489999999997,347.67600000000004,383.83689999999996,9,false],["Allow time for confession.",164.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,263.85900000000004,396.83689999999996,9,false],["Thanksgiving: Giving thanks to God for who He is,",146.40000000000001,410.34589999999992,337.47000000000008,423.05389999999994,9,false],["what He has done, what He will do in our lives and",146.40000000000001,423.43189999999993,336.00300000000004,435.83389999999991,9,false],["what He is doing in the ministry; a prayer expressing",146.40000000000001,436.42789999999991,345.0750000000001,448.8298999999999,9,false],["gratitude.",146.40000000000001,449.42389999999989,183.44400000000002,461.82589999999988,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,475.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,487.83689999999996,9,false],["Spend time in thanksgiving by reviewing I",164.40000000000001,475.43489999999997,323.88900000000001,487.83689999999996,9,false],["Thessalonians 5:18, Ephesians 5:20, Psalm 108:3,",164.40000000000001,488.43089999999995,349.41300000000007,500.83289999999994,9,false],["Psalm 50:23.",164.40000000000001,501.42689999999993,212.48700000000002,513.82889999999998,9,false],["Supplication: Asking God for his divine help to meet",146.40000000000001,527.09489999999994,344.98500000000001,540.47789999999986,9,false],["needs, solve problems, work in someone’s life, etc.",146.40000000000001,540.4239,334.47300000000001,552.82589999999993,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,566.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,578.83690000000001,9,false],["Read Philippians 4:6,7; Psalm 116:1,2 and lead the",164.40000000000001,566.43489999999997,350.64600000000007,578.83690000000001,9,false],["group in supplication by praying aloud.",164.40000000000001,579.43090000000007,311.73000000000002,591.8329,9,false],["INTRODUCE THE ‘PRAY’ ACROSTIC",146.40000000000001,615.91489999999999,258.28500000000003,631.31989999999996,15,false],["The elements of the praying time would be: a time",146.40000000000001,631.43489999999997,334.65300000000008,643.83690000000001,9,false],["of Praise; a time of Repentance; a time to Ask for",146.40000000000001,644.34090000000003,329.80199999999996,657.0489,9,false],["someone else; and a time to pray forYour own needs.",146.40000000000001,657.33690000000001,343.28400000000011,670.04489999999998,9,false],["PRAY FOR THE FULFILLMENT OF THE GREAT COMMISSION",146.40000000000001,693.91489999999999,336.96000000000004,709.31989999999996,15,false],["Use scriptures to pray for the fulfillment of the",146.40000000000001,709.43489999999997,322.34100000000012,721.83690000000001,9,false],["Great Commission, praying in the following three",370.20299999999997,33.435899999999833,557.71800000000007,45.837899999999877,9,false],["categories:",370.20299999999997,46.431899999999814,411.39599999999996,58.833899999999858,9,false],["Evangelism",370.20299999999997,72.342899999999872,415.923,85.050899999999842,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,85.434899999999857,374.34000000000003,97.836899999999901,9,false],["Pray that God will prepare individuals to",388.20000000000005,85.434899999999857,542.07300000000009,97.836899999999901,9,false],["understand and respond to the gospel (John",388.20000000000005,98.430899999999838,554.45700000000011,110.83289999999988,9,false],["6:44).",388.20000000000005,111.42689999999982,410.09700000000004,123.82889999999986,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,124.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,136.8368999999999,9,false],["Pray that God will motivate believers to share the",388.20000000000005,124.43489999999986,574.71600000000012,136.8368999999999,9,false],["gospel with the unbelievers (Matthew 9:37,38).",388.20000000000005,137.43089999999984,565.37400000000002,149.83289999999988,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,150.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,162.8368999999999,9,false],["Recognize that Satan has blinded the unbeliever,",388.20000000000005,150.43489999999986,572.10600000000011,162.8368999999999,9,false],["and acknowledge Christ’s victory (Ephesians",388.20000000000005,163.43089999999984,559.00200000000007,175.83289999999988,9,false],["6:12; II Corinthians 4:3,4; II Timothy 2:25,26; I",388.20000000000005,176.42689999999982,563.70000000000016,188.82889999999986,9,false],["John 3:8).",388.20000000000005,189.4228999999998,425.88300000000004,201.82489999999984,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,202.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,214.8368999999999,9,false],["Persist in these prayers (Daniel 10:12-13; Luke",388.20000000000005,202.43489999999986,563.33100000000013,214.8368999999999,9,false],["18:1-8).",388.20000000000005,215.43089999999984,416.27100000000007,227.83289999999988,9,false],["Discipleship",370.20000000000005,241.3418999999999,418.40400000000005,254.04989999999987,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,254.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,266.8368999999999,9,false],["Thank God for them (Philippians 1:3).",388.20000000000005,254.43489999999986,531.7410000000001,266.8368999999999,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,267.43489999999986,374.34000000000003,279.8368999999999,9,false],["Pray for deliverance from evil (unprincipled)",388.20000000000005,267.43489999999986,558.61500000000012,279.8368999999999,9,false],["companions (II Thessalonians 3:2).",388.20000000000005,280.43089999999995,522.68700000000013,292.83289999999994,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,293.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,305.83689999999996,9,false],["Pray that they will walk worthy of the Lord",388.20000000000005,293.43489999999997,549.85800000000017,305.83689999999996,9,false],["(Colossians 1:10).",388.20000000000005,306.43089999999995,454.87200000000007,318.83289999999994,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,319.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,331.83689999999996,9,false],["Pray for wisdom and revelation in knowledge of",388.20000000000005,319.43489999999997,568.44299999999998,331.83689999999996,9,false],["Christ (Ephesians 1:17).",388.20000000000005,332.43089999999995,479.06400000000008,344.83289999999994,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,345.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,357.83689999999996,9,false],["Pray for them to be strengthened with might by",388.20000000000005,345.43489999999997,566.85000000000014,357.83689999999996,9,false],["His Spirit in the inner man (Ephesians 3:16).",388.20000000000005,358.43089999999995,557.16600000000005,370.83289999999994,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,371.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,383.83689999999996,9,false],["Pray for their unity in the Spirit with other",388.20000000000005,371.43489999999997,549.73200000000008,383.83689999999996,9,false],["believers (John 17:23).",388.20000000000005,384.43089999999995,473.77200000000005,396.83289999999994,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,397.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,409.83689999999996,9,false],["Pray that their love may abound and that they",388.20000000000005,397.43489999999997,560.30700000000024,409.83689999999996,9,false],["may approve the things that are excellent",388.20000000000005,410.43089999999995,543.85500000000025,422.83289999999994,9,false],["(Philippians 1:9,10).",388.20000000000005,423.42689999999993,463.84500000000008,435.82889999999992,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,436.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,448.83689999999996,9,false],["Pray for boldness and opportunities to present",388.20000000000005,436.43489999999997,564.17700000000013,448.83689999999996,9,false],["the gospel to others (Colossians 4:3, Ephesians",388.20000000000005,449.43089999999995,565.19400000000007,461.83289999999994,9,false],["6:19,20).",388.20000000000005,462.42689999999993,420.47400000000005,474.82889999999992,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,475.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,487.83689999999996,9,false],["Pray that they may mature and become fully",388.20000000000005,475.43489999999997,555.04200000000003,487.83689999999996,9,false],["assured of God’s will (Colossians 4:12).",388.20000000000005,488.43089999999995,535.30500000000006,500.83289999999994,9,false],["Sending",370.20000000000005,514.3418999999999,402.10500000000002,527.04989999999998,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,527.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,539.83690000000001,9,false],["Recognize the problem of the labor shortage in",388.20000000000005,527.43489999999997,564.48300000000017,539.83690000000001,9,false],["the spiritual harvest (Matthew 9:37,38; Romans",388.20000000000005,540.43090000000007,568.55100000000004,552.8329,9,false],["10:1315).",388.20000000000005,553.42689999999993,421.77000000000004,565.82889999999998,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,566.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,578.83690000000001,9,false],["Make a list of you want to send as missionaries",388.20000000000005,566.43489999999997,564.91500000000008,578.83690000000001,9,false],["(Isaiah 6:8; Matthew 9:37,38) and pray",388.20000000000005,579.43090000000007,532.875,591.8329,9,false],["persistently for them.",388.20000000000005,592.42689999999993,470.30700000000002,604.82889999999998,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,605.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,617.83690000000001,9,false],["Pray for the fulfillment of the Great Commission",388.20000000000005,605.43489999999997,571.97100000000012,617.83690000000001,9,false],["in your area and around the world, according to",388.20000000000005,618.43090000000007,566.90400000000011,630.8329,9,false],["His command and promise in Matthew 28:18-20",388.20000000000005,631.42689999999993,571.63800000000015,643.82889999999998,9,false],["and 1John 5:14,15.",388.20000000000005,644.42290000000003,457.03200000000004,656.82490000000007,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,657.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,669.83690000000001,9,false],["Mobilize and teach others to pray for laborers (2",388.20000000000005,657.43489999999997,570.50400000000013,669.83690000000001,9,false],["Timothy 2:2).",388.20000000000005,670.43089999999995,439.94100000000003,682.8329,9,false],["•",370.20000000000005,683.43489999999997,374.34000000000003,695.83690000000001,9,false],["Help expand the group’s world vision by praying",388.20000000000005,683.43489999999997,569.79300000000023,695.83690000000001,9,false],["for specific country, overseas mission worker or",388.20000000000005,696.43089999999995,569.12700000000018,708.8329,9,false],["group. (Your group may want to adopt a country",388.20000000000005,709.42689999999993,568.51500000000033,721.82889999999998,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"h":792},{"segs":[["H OW TO L E A D A P R AY E R M E E T I N G 3",43.841199999999994,509.49989999999997,57.071200000000005,652.95640000000003,9,false],["to pray for regularly.)",164.40000000000001,33.434899999999857,244.35600000000002,45.836899999999901,9,false],["will be prayed for by at least one other person.",370.20299999999997,33.427899999999909,543.23700000000008,45.829899999999952,9,false],["Additional Great Commission Prayers",146.40000000000001,59.345899999999915,295.20600000000002,72.053899999999885,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,72.434899999999857,150.54000000000002,84.836899999999901,9,false],["Christian students would confess their sins to",164.40000000000001,72.434899999999857,338.5680000000001,84.836899999999901,9,false],["God and choose to be filled with the Holy Spirit.",164.40000000000001,85.430899999999838,344.36400000000015,97.832899999999881,9,false],["Especially that Christians would break off",164.40000000000001,98.426899999999819,323.71800000000002,110.82889999999986,9,false],["immoral sexual",164.40000000000001,111.4228999999998,223.08000000000001,123.82489999999984,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,136.8368999999999,9,false],["relationships and be restored and walk in purity",164.40000000000001,124.43489999999986,345.76800000000014,136.8368999999999,9,false],["(I John 1:9; Joel 2:23).",164.40000000000001,137.43089999999984,247.47900000000001,149.83289999999988,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,162.8368999999999,9,false],["Non-Christians seek God and come to know",164.40000000000001,150.43489999999986,331.34100000000001,162.8368999999999,9,false],["Christ.",164.40000000000001,163.43089999999984,190.851,175.83289999999988,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,176.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,188.8368999999999,9,false],["The Holy Spirit convicts professors and",164.40000000000001,176.43489999999986,315.05100000000004,188.8368999999999,9,false],["administrators to receive Christ.",164.40000000000001,189.43089999999984,288.43799999999999,201.83289999999988,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,214.8368999999999,9,false],["God calls out committed believers in every",164.40000000000001,202.43489999999986,325.38300000000004,214.8368999999999,9,false],["area of campus. (residence halls, fraternities,",164.40000000000001,215.43089999999984,334.32000000000005,227.83289999999988,9,false],["sororities, student government, minority groups,",164.40000000000001,228.42689999999982,348.87300000000005,240.82889999999986,9,false],["athletes etc.)",164.40000000000001,241.4228999999998,213.45000000000002,253.82489999999984,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,254.43489999999986,150.54000000000002,266.8368999999999,9,false],["Evangelistic surveys and outreaches are done in",164.40000000000001,254.43489999999986,346.22700000000009,266.8368999999999,9,false],["every dorm, fraternity sorority and athletic team",164.40000000000001,267.43089999999984,348.24300000000005,279.83289999999988,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,293.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,305.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,319.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,331.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,345.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,357.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,396.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,448.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,449.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,461.83689999999996,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,501.43490000000003,150.54000000000002,513.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,514.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,526.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,553.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,565.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,579.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,591.83690000000001,9,false],["•",146.40000000000001,605.43489999999997,150.54000000000002,617.83690000000001,9,false],["on campus.",164.40000000000001,280.42689999999993,207.303,292.82889999999992,9,false],["Christians of different races become united in",164.40000000000001,293.43489999999997,338.3250000000001,305.83689999999996,9,false],["spirit, intent on one purpose.",164.40000000000001,306.43089999999995,273.84000000000003,318.83289999999994,9,false],["Spiritual awakening revives believers and brings",164.40000000000001,319.43489999999997,348.42300000000012,331.83689999999996,9,false],["large numbers of unbelievers to Christ.",164.40000000000001,332.43089999999995,311.93700000000001,344.83289999999994,9,false],["Students gain an eternal perspective instead of",164.40000000000001,345.43489999999997,341.98800000000006,357.83689999999996,9,false],["defaulting to the usual temporal perspective that",164.40000000000001,358.43089999999995,348.91800000000012,370.83289999999994,9,false],["pervades college life.",164.40000000000001,371.42689999999993,243.23099999999999,383.82889999999992,9,false],["Graduating seniors would go where God",164.40000000000001,384.43489999999997,316.15800000000002,396.83689999999996,9,false],["calls them and they wouldn’t seek security or",164.40000000000001,397.43089999999995,334.57200000000012,409.83289999999994,9,false],["materialism but instead serve God as full-time",164.40000000000001,410.42689999999993,340.36800000000005,422.82889999999992,9,false],["missionaries in their",164.40000000000001,423.42289999999991,243.51000000000002,435.8248999999999,9,false],["careers after graduation.",164.40000000000001,436.43489999999997,257.82900000000001,448.83689999999996,9,false],["The Great Commission (Matthew 28:18-20)",164.40000000000001,449.43489999999997,331.49400000000003,461.83689999999996,9,false],["becomes the most important mission for every",164.40000000000001,462.43089999999995,340.899,474.83289999999994,9,false],["Christian on your campus and that Christians",164.40000000000001,475.42689999999993,338.10900000000009,487.82889999999992,9,false],["become pioneers of faith.",164.40000000000001,488.42289999999991,259.899,500.8248999999999,9,false],["Christians end all gossip and criticism.",164.40000000000001,501.43490000000003,311.76599999999996,513.83690000000001,9,false],["Spiritual awakening on campus affects the",164.40000000000001,514.43489999999997,325.08600000000007,526.83690000000001,9,false],["surrounding community and hundreds of",164.40000000000001,527.43090000000007,321.0270000000001,539.8329,9,false],["students fill churches every week.",164.40000000000001,540.42690000000005,292.30800000000011,552.82889999999998,9,false],["Your zeal and love for Christ touches many",164.40000000000001,553.43489999999997,326.35500000000002,565.83690000000001,9,false],["campuses nearby.",164.40000000000001,566.43090000000007,231.81,578.8329,9,false],["The greatest skeptics of Christianity on campus",164.40000000000001,579.43489999999997,345.79500000000007,591.83690000000001,9,false],["are won to Christ.",164.40000000000001,592.43090000000007,231.99900000000002,604.8329,9,false],["For a growing worldwide network of prayer",164.40000000000001,605.43489999999997,328.4430000000001,617.83690000000001,9,false],["movements, a college student uprising",164.40000000000001,618.43090000000007,309.75,630.8329,9,false],["You may wish to have group members record on a",370.20299999999997,59.428899999999885,556.79100000000005,71.830899999999929,9,false],["sheet of paper each request as it is given. They can",370.20299999999997,72.424899999999866,559.7700000000001,84.82689999999991,9,false],["refer to the list during the group prayer time as well as",370.20299999999997,85.420899999999847,574.30500000000006,97.82289999999989,9,false],["throughout the week.",370.20299999999997,98.416899999999828,450.95999999999998,110.81889999999987,9,false],["Allow group members to volunteer to pray for",370.20299999999997,124.4178999999998,542.52600000000007,136.81989999999985,9,false],["requests without assigning them or writing them",370.20299999999997,137.41389999999978,555.61200000000008,149.81589999999983,9,false],["down. This way members would rely on their",370.20299999999997,150.40989999999977,540.31200000000013,162.81189999999981,9,false],["memories during the prayer time.",370.20299999999997,163.40589999999975,497.53500000000008,175.80789999999979,9,false],["You can pray for each request as soon as it’s given,",370.20299999999997,189.40689999999972,558.096,201.80889999999977,9,false],["before sharing the next request.",370.20299999999997,202.4028999999997,490.101,214.80489999999975,9,false],["OTHER THINGS TO KEEP IN MIND",146.40000000000001,663.81989999999996,290.56000000000006,684.35990000000004,20,false],["As a prayer request is offered, have another member",146.40000000000001,683.43489999999997,342.88800000000003,695.83690000000001,9,false],["be responsible to pray for that request during the",146.40000000000001,696.43089999999995,331.08900000000011,708.8329,9,false],["prayer time. This ensures that each person’s request",146.40000000000001,709.42689999999993,343.83300000000003,721.82889999999998,9,false],["© 2010, CruPress, All Rights Reserved. CruPress.com",204.23800660000001,766.03521969999997,407.76200660000006,778.43721970000001,9,false]],"h":792,"ocr":false,"w":612}]}